          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We replace <span class=\"math\">[MATH: x]</span> with <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 5]</span> in the expression and simplify as much as possible.</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (x \u2212 2)/(x + 1)|=; (5 \u2212 2)/(5 + 1)|=; (3)/(6)|=; (1)/(2)]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We replace [MATH: x] with [MATH: 5] in the expression and simplify as much as possible.\n\n[MATH: (x \u2212 2)/(x + 1)|=; (5 \u2212 2)/(5 + 1)|=; (3)/(6)|=; (1)/(2)]",
            "images": [],
